cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article.
title: "exomass: mass inference for exoplanets from catalogue observables"
abstract: >-
  Trained regressors that predict exoplanet masses from archive observables,
  split into a small-planet and a giant-planet regime, with a physics cascade
  that fills derivable predictors so that only a planet radius is strictly
  required.
